6/j.physletb.2017.06.015"],"label":"70"},"raw_refs":[{"schema":"text","value":"[70] RA Konoplya, Z Stuchlík: Are eikonal quasinormal modes linked to the unstable circular null geodesics?, ['Phys.Lett.,B771,597-602'], DOI: 10.1016/j.physletb.2017.06.015"}],"curated_relation":false,"record":{"$ref":"https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/1599949"}},{"reference":{"dois":["10.1103/PhysRevD.99.124042"],"label":"71"},"raw_refs":[{"schema":"text","value":"[71] RA Konoplya, AF Zinhailo, Z Stuchlík: Quasinormal modes, scattering, and Hawking radiation in the vicinity of an Einstein-dilaton-Gauss–Bonnet black hole, ['Phys.Rev.,D99,124042'], DOI: 10.1103/PhysRevD.99.124042"}],"curated_relation":false,"record":{"$ref":"https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/1724391"}},{"reference":{"dois":["10.1103/PhysRevD.70.064024"],"label":"72"},"raw_refs":[{"schema":"text","value":"[72] D-P Du, B Wang, R-K Su: Quasinormal modes in pure de sitter spacetimes, ['Phys.Rev.,D70,064024'], DOI: 10.1103/PhysRevD.70.064024"}],"curated_relation":false,"record":{"$ref":"https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/647729"}},{"reference":{"dois":["10.1007/s10714-012-1398-4"],"label":"73"},"raw_refs":[{"schema":"text","value":"[73] A Lopez-Ortega: On the quasinormal modes of the de Sitter spacetime, ['Gen.Rel.Grav.,44,2387-2400'], DOI: 10.1007/s10714-012-1398-4"}],"curated_relation":false,"record":{"$ref":"https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/1124141"}},{"reference":{"dois":["10.1103/PhysRevD.66.104018"],"label":"74"},"raw_refs":[{"schema":"text","value":"[74] E Abdalla, KHC Castello-Branco, A Lima-Santos: Support of ds/cft correspondence from space-time perturbations, ['Phys.Rev.,D66,104018'], DOI: 10.1103/PhysRevD.66.104018"}],"curated_relation":false,"record":{"$ref":"https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/592233"}},{"reference":{"dois":["10.1103/PhysRevD.72.084006"],"label":"75"},"raw_refs":[{"schema":"text","value":"[75] E Abdalla, RA Konoplya, C Molina: Scalar field evolution in Gauss–Bonnet black holes, 